WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
Please remember the names of the materials I submit.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,360
Are they all here?

3
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,360
It's all here

4
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:08,360
It doesn't hurt that quite a lot of stuff isn't cheap.

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,280
Is it cheap for us?

6
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,440
There's no use in our town

7
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,560
Except for the gunman

8
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:15,920
There is nothing worth paying for Zhang Dao at all.

9
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,200
General Xiao

10
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:20,000
What are you going to do with us?

11
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,800
Now it can no longer be sold to the Central Plains. Don’t worry about it.

12
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,000
Of course I have a way

13
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,200
But if I get the materials back

14
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:27,200
can you do it for me

15
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,860
Of course it works

16
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:32,220
Then I'll leave first

17
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:41,900
General Xiao, I've finished eating the slow-walking meat. I've finished eating it. I've finished it long ago.

18
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:44,260
But it would be nice to have food, I know

19
00:00:44,990 --> 00:00:46,830
I'll bring us something over in two days.

20
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:49,620
And give this thing to Mr. Fan

21
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,300
Let him inquire about it

22
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,940
Where can I buy these materials? The general is out of gas.

23
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:57,380
I'll get it back in the next two days. You can inquire first. Don't worry.

24
00:00:57,940 --> 00:01:00,340
Our lives will get better and better over time

25
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:01,900
I will definitely let you eat big fish and meat

26
00:01:02,060 --> 00:01:04,020
Is it true? General Xiao is nonsense.

27
00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:05,140
When did I lie to you?

28
00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:08,180
Will we still be able to eat green vegetables by then? Will green vegetables be delicious?

29
00:01:08,420 --> 00:01:09,460
It must be delicious

30
00:01:09,860 --> 00:01:11,380
It's good for your health to eat it that night

31
00:01:11,620 --> 00:01:12,780
The general is still awesome
